- Mapped to chapter PRE: Patient Rights and Education (PRE).
- Owner: Quality Manager; departments: Quality / Patient Relations.
- Current policy/SOP and training records available.
- Operational records / sampling for As Applicable.
- Evidence pack for Document ready.
- KPIs/committees reviewed; NC/CAPA closed with evidence.', N'Medium', N'High', N'NABH;6E;PRE;OE;PRE.4.c;Document;PRE.4', 1, 1);
