- Mapped to chapter COP: Care of Patients (COP).
- Owner: Chief Medical Officer; departments: Clinical / Nursing.
- Current policy/SOP and training records available.
- Operational records / sampling for As Applicable.
- Evidence pack for Document ready.
- KPIs/committees reviewed; NC/CAPA closed with evidence.', N'Medium', N'High', N'NABH;6E;COP;OE;COP.10.e;Document;COP.10', 1, 1);
